# Who reviews the platform's own files: the shell, the build, the checks, the workflows, the package
# snapshots and the dependency lockfile. With "Require review from Code Owners" on main, a pull request
# that changes them needs one of these owners' approval. A game's own directory has no owner, so a game
# contribution needs any maintainer's approval and nothing more; scripts/games.mjs, which adding a game
# edits, is left unowned for the same reason.
#
# Replace the owner with a team (@Crashwif/<team>) once the maintainers are more than one person.
/.github/ @przmyst
/apps/ @przmyst
/packages/ @przmyst
/scripts/ @przmyst
/scripts/games.mjs
/games/tsconfig.json @przmyst
/package.json @przmyst
/package-lock.json @przmyst
/tsconfig.base.json @przmyst
/UPSTREAM.json @przmyst
/.gitattributes @przmyst
/.nvmrc @przmyst
